==============================================================================
B. HOW MANY ANSWERS THE COORDINATE PAIR CAN SUPPORT
==============================================================================
  family                   coordinate 2            cells  widest cell (decades)
  bitpack-carrier-width    declared bytes/elem         9                    inf
  bitpack-carrier-width    declared bytes/elem, control dropped      9                    inf
  bitpack-carrier-width    IQR of algo_ns             10                    inf
  bitpack-contend-decode   IQR of algo_ns              9                    inf
  bitpack-contention       IQR of algo_ns             12                    inf
  bitpack-wide             IQR of algo_ns              8                    inf

A cell is a set of weightings that are the same strategy. The count is
how many distinguishable strategies the coordinate pair supports at all;
the width is how wrong a declared exchange rate may be and still select
the shipped table.

